OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start with fog in
OL,6,Fplaces which may be slow to clear.
OL,7,FOtherwise dry with variable cloud and
OL,8,Fincreasing bright or sunny spells.
OL,9,FLight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry with some clear spells
OL,12,Fand light winds allowing a touch of
OL,13,Ffrost in places, as well as the chance
OL,14,Fof fog.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FAny overnight fog may be
OL,17,Fquite slow to clear. Otherwise dry
OL,18,Fwith bright or sunny spells
OL,19,Fdeveloping. Chance of some frost and
OL,20,Ffog developing again overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
