OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FTurning chillier but staying dry and
OL,7,Fsunny on Wednesday and Thursday.
OL,8,FOvernight frost and fog possible under
OL,9,Fclearer skies. A touch milder with
OL,10,Fbright spells and a few showers Friday.
